  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "- There is a ladder with <b>16</b> steps and player starts at a step on
    the ladder\n  depending on the number of <b>Bonus Symbols</b> at the end of <b>Bonus
    Mode</b>.\n- There are two numbers in <b>Guess or Dare Bonus</b>.\n- <b>Target
    Number</b>: reveals a random number from <b>5</b> to <b>15</b> every step.\n-
    <b>Player's Number</b>: reveals a random number from <b>0</b> to <b>20</b> every
    step.\n- In order to move higher on the ladder, player chooses '<b>High</b>' or
    '<b>Low</b>', guessing\n  if <b>Player's Number</b> will be higher or lower than
    <b>Target Number</b>.\n 1. If player's guess is correct, then move onto the next
    step of the ladder.\n 2. If player's guess is incorrect, then player wins the
    prize from the closest safe step.\n- Anytime before choosing '<b>High</b>' or
    '<b>Low</b>', player can take prize and quit <b>Bonus</b>.\n- There are safe steps
    on the ladder and if player is at such step or above that step,\n  all wins from
    previous steps are safely saved.\n- Player can receive the prize on the closest
    safe stop when player lost the game. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
